## 6. Negative Boundaries & Absolute Functional Ceilings
*Enforcing Rule 30: explicit documentation of what this item CANNOT do.*

1. **Negative Boundary 1 (Absolute Planar Ceilings):** <The item CANNOT generate infinite kinetic energy or perpetual motion; all work requires mechanical spring tension, chemical propellant, or soul power.>
2. **Negative Boundary 2 (Biological Storage Limits):** <Spatial storage tools CANNOT sustain living, breathing biological entities unless explicitly engineered with planar life arrays.>
3. **Negative Boundary 3 (Material Hardness Ceilings):** <Mortal metals CANNOT resist God-level divine power; divine weapon clashes shatter sub-heavenly alloys instantaneously.>
4. **Negative Boundary 4 (Sanderson Cost Hard Floor):** <Every activation consumes non-recoverable mechanical parts or energetic fuel; zero free utility permitted.>

