## 9. Standardized Lexicon & Taxonomy Glossary

| Term / Taxonomy | Category | Clear & Accessible Definition |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Thousand Refinement (*Qianlian*)** | Metallurgy | Forging technique removing all impurities from metal, creating metallic resonance and basic soul power conductivity. |
| **Spirit Refinement (*Linglian*)** | Metallurgy | Advanced forging imparting biological vitality and elemental intelligence into the metal, bonding with the smith's soul. |
| **Soul Tool (*DaoHunqi / Hunqi*)** | Technology | Artifact embedded with precise soul power core arrays that produce magical, defensive, or spatial effects. |
| **External Spirit Bone (*Waifu Hungu*)** | Anatomy | Extremely rare bone not bound to the 6 primary slots, capable of evolving alongside the host and fusing with weapons. |
| **Hidden Weapon (*Anqi*)** | Ballistics | Mechanical or hand-thrown precision weaponry designed for lethal ambush, bypassing soul master defensive expectations. |
| **Milk Bottle (*Nainping*)** | Storage | Specialized cylindrical soul tool used to store purified liquid soul power for rapid tactical field replenishment. |
| **Sanderson Limitation** | Narrative | Explicit recoil, ammunition limit, or failure mode ensuring artifacts remain balanced tactical tools rather than story-breaking cheats. |
